{"name": "execute_code", "arguments": {"action": "execute", "code": "var asm=typeof(UnityEditor.EditorWindow).Assembly;var t=asm.GetType(\"UnityEditor.GameViewSizes\");\nvar singleton=typeof(UnityEditor.ScriptableSingleton<>).MakeGenericType(t);var instance=singleton.GetProperty(\"instance\",System.Reflection.BindingFlags.Public|System.Reflection.BindingFlags.Static|System.Reflection.BindingFlags.FlattenHierarchy).GetValue(null,null);\nvar groupType=asm.GetType(\"UnityEditor.GameViewSizeGroupType\");var group=t.GetMethod(\"GetGroup\").Invoke(instance,new object[]{System.Enum.Parse(groupType,\"Standalone\")});\nreturn new {texts=group.GetType().GetMethod(\"GetDisplayTexts\").Invoke(group,null),methods=System.Linq.Enumerable.ToArray(System.Linq.Enumerable.Select(group.GetType().GetMethods(),m=>m.ToString()))};"}}